  "limits": [
    "Episode-only is a visit-weighted GiGPO ablation with invalid-action penalties, not standard episode-weighted GRPO.",
    "GraphPO uses paper-based code without located official implementation; GTE and constrained extractive summaries are material adaptations from the paper.",
    "GraphPO has 124 leaf paths over48 task graphs; other methods have96 rollouts over12 rounds. Update counts and compute differ. No method ranking is claimed.",
    "v3 parsing differs from native DCC; selected examples and protocol-sensitive supplementary examples are distinguished. Static parser comparison is not a native-protocol rerun.",
    "The source reward is case-sensitive; casefold sensitivity is separate from credit-method observations.",
    "A positive advantage is a relative training weight, not a causal usefulness label. Fixed-sample credit recomputation does not establish trained or counterfactual task gains.",
    "Most trajectories end quickly; these observations do not establish performance on full long-horizon tasks."
  ],
